  "description": "To apply, please provide a short rental biography including information about who would be living in the property, your previous rental experience, and any references you may wish to provide.\n\nBeautifully Refurbished 2-Bedroom Home in the Heart of Midleton\n\nThis beautifully renovated and fully furnished 2-bedroom home is ideally located in the centre of Midleton town, offering modern living with exceptional convenience.\n\nRecently refurbished to a very high standard throughout, the property features a modern fully fitted kitchen, stylish bathroom, new flooring, and quality furnishings in every room. The accommodation comprises two spacious double bedrooms, a contemporary bathroom with rainfall shower, and a bright, comfortable living space designed for modern living.\n\nSituated in a prime town-center location adjacent to the Talbot Hotel, the property is within a two-minute walk of supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, and bars. Midleton Train Station is just a six-minute walk away, while a bus stop with direct services to Cork City is located immediately across the road.\n\nFeatures Include:\n\nRenovated and refurbished throughout\nTwo spacious double bedrooms\nModern fully fitted kitchen\nModern bathroom with rainfall shower\nNew flooring throughout\nFully furnished to a high specification\nGas central heating with instant hot water\nWashing machine and dryer\nDishwasher and microwave\nPrime Midleton town-centre location\n2-minute walk to shops, restaurants and amenities\n6-minute walk to Midleton Train Station\nBus route to Cork City directly across the road\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to rent a high-quality home in one of East Cork's most sought-after locations.\n\nAvailable from early October 2026. Viewing highly recommended.",
